search/videos/2026-si-household-finance-paul-goldsmith-pinkham-using-ai-household-finance-research-practical-guide\">\n<span>2026, SI Household Finance, Paul Goldsmith-Pinkham, \"Using AI in Household Finance Research: A Practical Guide\"</span>\n</a></p></div> <ul> <li>Video</li> </ul> <ul> <li> Presenter: <span> <a href=\"https://www.nber.org/people/paul_goldsmithpinkham\">Paul Goldsmith-Pinkham</a> </span> </li> </ul> <p>Supported by the Vanguard Group</p> </div>\n</div> </section></div>",
